# .dockerignore — keep the build context minimal and secret-free (E1, HF staging Space).
# The Dockerfile needs package manifests, source, public/ and next.config,
# PLUS docs/methodology/*.md: the /methodology pages read them at BUILD
# time (lib/methodology/index.ts, S2-01) — excluding them broke the image
# build with "ENOENT ... /app/docs/methodology" (caught by the CI
# docker-space job and the first HF build; see docs/evidence/round18/).
# .env* must never enter the image (Constitution rule 8) — this exclusion
# is asserted by test/dockerfile.invariants.test.ts.
.git
.github
node_modules
.next
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.md
!README.md
docs
!docs/methodology
!docs/methodology/*.md
artifacts
scripts
test
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
*.log
.DS_Store
